WEBVTT

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:15.990
Kintoki!

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:17.690
Yes!

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.670
So he is not a Horror...

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:26.570
Ashiya Douman.

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:31.060
If you continue like this, you will be consumed by the darkness one day.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.710
That is my wish.

00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:59.770
<i>A seal guarded since ancient times</i>

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:07.880
<i>Now it falls and turns to thorns</i>

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:15.080
<i>Remnants of resentment brought to</i> <i>life by the darkness of night take breath</i>

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:24.120
<i>What does that pyre desire</i> <i>and why does it beckon</i>

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:33.470
<i>The flowers of darkness</i> <i>that fear and hate the light</i>

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:41.310
<i>Rakshasa, who dances</i> <i>wrapped in a cloak of blood</i>

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:49.180
<i>Release and call back the golden armor</i>

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:59.180
<i>The blade, which can cut</i> <i>through inevitable destiny</i>

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:05.370
<i>Night of the crimson moon</i>

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:09.980
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:14.980
"TIED SWORD"

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:21.570
Hey!

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:28.620
It appeared.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:31.820
The evil spirit that has been causing problems in this area lately.

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:40.130
What a nice sword! I shall take it.

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:44.470
That is mine!

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:48.070
A good sword chooses its wielder.

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:51.480
Which of us will it be?

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:23.040
How wonderful!
The way it's cracked is exquisite!

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:24.750
Seimei.

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:25.880
Hey, Seimei.

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:27.950
You mean, Seimei-<i>san.</i>

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:30.050
Seimei-<i>sama</i> will work, too.

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:32.850
Though I refuse being called Mother Seimei.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.760
Hm? Let me see that one, too!

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:37.460
--Sure.
--Who was that guy?

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:39.930
Ashiya Douman.

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:41.700
So you do know him.

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:43.960
Who is he? Is he a Makai Alchemist?!

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:49.250
Looking closely, this one isn't that great.

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:13.460
Oh, Seimei-<i>dono</i>. How are you doing?

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:17.500
I am not a woman that should be worried about by Kintou<i>-sama,</i>

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:21.940
head of the police magistrate that manages all disputes in the capital.

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:23.570
Now, excuse me.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:26.610
Now, hold on.

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:31.110
When will you accept
Michinaga-<i>sama</i>'s affections?

00:04:31.110 --> 00:04:34.310
You cannot run away forever.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:39.090
Sir.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:41.150
Escape!

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:46.450
We'll catch her eventually.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:05:00.780
No matter how many people are eaten up by Horrors, they don't care.

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:03.370
That goes the same for you.

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:08.350
Makai Alchemist Seimei, you are summoned to the Watchdog Center.

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:11.390
Oh, today really isn't a good day!

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:15.020
Hey, wait! Hold on!

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:29.300
What? So you were caught, too?

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:33.040
I am different from her!
You do not have to do this with me.

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:39.150
Long time no see, Seimei, Raiko.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.850
This Eastern Watchdog Center is where

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:43.990
Makai Knights and
Makai Alchemists of the capital gather.

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.990
Do you have some information on a Horror?

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:48.920
I've told you before.

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:51.990
I don't have the time to take jobs from you.

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:55.900
Hoh? Are you too busy hunting Horrors?

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:59.530
Yes. Even without information from the Watchdog Center.

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:03.670
You're just busy collecting strange items for your collection.

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:09.050
This is a problem. This request was specifically for the two of you.

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:10.580
--I'll do it!
--I refuse!

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:18.390
Th-Th-Th-This feeling! It can't be!

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:19.850
Yeah, it's a butterfly.

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:23.860
T-T-T-Take it off of me.
Please! Take it quickly! Take it!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:26.860
Oh? You still don't like butterflies?

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:30.230
It's not that I don't like them! I hate them!

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:33.270
No! Th-Their pollen will get in my mouth!

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:38.040
Quite the problem, young lady.
You hate them that much?

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:43.210
This kind of method is terrible!

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:46.310
It's fine if you don't want to do it. You seem busy.

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:50.650
I'll do it. I will do any job you want me to!

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:53.990
I see. What a good child you are.

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:01.130
My name is Katsuragino Hisayori.

00:07:02.760 --> 00:07:05.760
A Makai Knight apprentice?

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:10.740
In other words, you're a brand new Makai Knight

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:12.940
that hasn't even inherited your armor yet.

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:17.680
And so, you'd like to shadow your seniors while they work, correct?

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:21.210
Please take care of me, Raiko-<i>dono.</i>

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:24.820
W-Well! I still have a long way to go myself.

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:27.020
That's exactly right!

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:30.830
No, I have heard of your great achievement.

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:33.160
You were able to summon the Golden Armor back

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:35.800
that was once thought gone forever.

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:39.100
Th-That really isn't something that amazing...

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:42.940
I would like to inherit my father's armor as soon as possible!

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.960
Wow! So your father was a Makai Knight?

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:49.540
Kintoki!

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:52.610
We are already struggling to put food on the table,

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:56.350
yet the great senior here added another to our budget.

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:03.310
By the way, this...

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:13.230
Wh-Wh-Wh-Why are you undressed like that?!

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:16.840
I'm checking to see if any loathsome pollen got on me.

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:18.010
The butterfly pollen?

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:21.840
Don't utter their name!

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:24.680
Sorry. Can you wipe my back?

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:25.850
Y-Yes!

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:27.080
Not you!

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.110
Me?

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:32.590
Hisayori-<i>dono.</i>

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:37.020
I heard that you specifically requested to apprentice under us.

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:39.060
Your names precede you.

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:43.100
Could it be that you're interested in me?

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:46.400
No, I wish to learn Raiko-<i>dono</i>'s sword style.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:49.940
So you're another idiot who wants to fight

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:52.530
because it's the duty of a protector.

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:56.910
Protector...

00:08:56.910 --> 00:08:59.110
No, I couldn't...

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:02.550
...protect anyone.

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:12.360
Warriors with well-known swords have been attacked one after another.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:13.760
A Horror?

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:20.970
Speaking of swords, I believe
Raiko-<i>dono</i>'s is famous as well.

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:23.040
That one?

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:26.610
It's not anything special.
I've had it for a long time.

00:09:26.610 --> 00:09:29.980
Did you inherit it from your father?

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:31.950
No, I didn't.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:35.710
I do not know my father.

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:42.090
I was abandoned outside of the capital.

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:56.780
Katsuragino Hisayori. Hisayori...

00:09:56.780 --> 00:10:00.050
I can only depend on you, Izumi Shikibu-<i>sama.</i>

00:10:00.050 --> 00:10:02.620
You can just call me Izumi-<i>chan.</i>

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:06.120
It's rare for you to depend on me for anything.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.560
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:10:11.730 --> 00:10:15.730
Oh, I see. He is the son of Katsuragino Chiharu.

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:20.410
One who fights evil spirits...
He was what you call a Makai Knight.

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:24.240
He was suspected of being part of a rebellion in the East.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:26.710
And he escaped from the capital?

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:41.060
Father...

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:43.360
Do not be afraid, Hisayori.

00:10:43.360 --> 00:10:45.060
You must live on!

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:49.400
One step outside of the capital and you're in a world controlled by spirits.

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:52.500
It is written that Chiharu died there.

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:04.610
The Makai Knight father fell and only the son returned alive.

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:07.750
Life is so fleeting.

00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:16.020
Why, Seimei.

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:24.370
Minister of the Left.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:27.370
Are you still not ready to be mine?

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:29.310
How you jest.

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:40.450
Who was that just now?

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:42.450
A woman who lives at night.

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:44.560
Just like those evil spirits.

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:46.960
She was born of high status.

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:48.460
What a waste.

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:51.500
She chose to live in the darkness herself.

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:55.470
She came here to talk to
Izumi Shikibu about the West.

00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:57.130
I know.

00:12:08.850 --> 00:12:10.180
Who is it?!

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:12.240
What are you doing there?!

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:18.190
Kintoki!

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:20.320
Raiko-<i>sama</i>! A thief!

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.270
It's you.

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:39.270
Hisayori.

00:12:44.350 --> 00:12:47.150
That is my father's sword!

00:12:47.150 --> 00:12:48.290
Father?

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:51.290
My father died. He was killed.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:54.960
Since you hold his sword, you must have been the murderer!

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.120
It can't be!

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:05.330
Raiko-<i>sama,</i> he is a Horror!

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:07.870
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:11.900
You killed my father, Raiko!

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:24.700
To think an apprentice Makai Knight would be possessed by a Horror...

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:30.160
There's no way the
Watchdog Center didn't notice!

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:33.500
They pushed a troublesome task over to us!

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:38.700
So they wanted us to quietly eliminate the failure apprentice.

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.340
Let's go, Raiko.

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:44.380
What's wrong?

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:48.410
When did this sword come into my possession?

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:52.120
Hmm, I wonder.

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:59.080
I may have killed his father!

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:16.810
Is he really that man's child?!

00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:23.040
Yes. Though he is the eldest, he was exiled along with his mother.

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:29.550
We could do nothing to save them.

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:32.420
A child that inherited the blood of a Makai Knight.

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:35.090
If he is still alive...

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:52.010
A-A Horror!

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:53.240
No.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:09.510
Show me your true form!

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:13.700
A Horror?

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:16.330
They attacked in hopes of a meal.

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:20.000
Like moths to a fire!

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:24.340
And what is the food that attracted so many Horrors?!

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:30.480
It can't be!

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:35.720
He summoned the Golden Armor subconsciously and survived?

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:40.060
No, the armor protected this child?

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.700
Madou Ring.

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:59.580
I am Zaruba. The one who stands alongside the Golden Knight.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:03.650
Any Makai Knight who dons his armor too long...

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:05.580
Their body and soul would be consumed by the armor

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:09.020
and they will never again return to their original form.

00:16:09.020 --> 00:16:11.090
A lost soul beast.

00:16:11.090 --> 00:16:15.060
And this child did not transform?

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:16.860
He is a chosen child.

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:35.900
This child is my Makai Knight.

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:44.790
I have no memory of that time.

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:50.560
I may have been partially eaten by Horrors, turning into one myself.

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:53.630
Then, I may have killed Hisayori's father...

00:16:53.630 --> 00:16:56.870
If so, what will you do?

00:16:56.870 --> 00:17:00.940
To begin with, you don't even know if that sword really was his father's.

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:03.910
I think that even that's questionable.

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:07.310
So, what do you want to do?

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:10.610
If this is the sword of
Hisayori's father, I will return it.

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:12.620
Hisayori is a Horror.

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:16.950
There is no meaning in returning a memento like that.

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:20.990
He lost his father and was surrounded by Horrors.

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:25.730
He had no choice, but to become one himself!

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:30.070
I was the same. Just a bit more and I...

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:33.970
And you call yourself a protector, Raiko?

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:46.750
You won't return it?

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:52.160
Then I will have the sword choose its rightful owner!

00:17:57.830 --> 00:18:00.430
Who will you choose?

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:05.770
The son, Hisayori. Or the murderer, Raiko?

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:11.610
If the sword really has a will, then...

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:17.350
You better not be thinking of letting a sword decide.

00:18:17.350 --> 00:18:20.890
I won't allow that, Raiko.

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:26.020
I am the one who decides whether you live or die.

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:32.530
I'm the one who controls my life.

00:18:32.530 --> 00:18:35.360
The sword wants Raiko's life!

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:43.240
I was once inside that darkness.

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:49.250
That is why I yearn the light more than anyone else!

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:51.410
Let me protect that light!

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:02.660
The sword accepted Raiko-<i>sama</i> as its master!

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:06.290
Father... Why?

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:09.260
Shit!

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:18.080
Seimei.

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:20.240
To think you'd order me.

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:25.740
Zaruba.

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:14.660
Father...

00:20:31.820 --> 00:20:36.490
That Golden Knight, Raiko.

00:20:36.490 --> 00:20:40.290
His real name is Minamotono Yorimitsu.

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:43.330
Yorimitsu?

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:47.200
A cursed child.

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:49.330
Like you.

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:55.170
Oh, this is nice!

00:20:56.370 --> 00:20:58.310
That's Katsuragino Chiharu.

00:20:58.310 --> 00:21:00.540
Do you get it? Hisayori's father.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:04.950
A Makai Knight that once owned that sword.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:08.820
Why did Hisayori have that skull?

00:21:08.820 --> 00:21:11.810
That's because Hisayori ate Chiharu.

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:20.360
In order to escape his guilt,
Hisayori made himself believe

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:24.800
the one who held his sword killed his father.

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:31.410
The sword must have come to your possession in order to defeat Hisayori.

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:33.640
You knew, Seimei.

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:36.680
Then why didn't you tell me earlier?

00:21:36.680 --> 00:21:40.050
I was worried that I was the one who killed Hisayori's father...

00:21:40.050 --> 00:21:43.750
He became a Horror and you didn't.

00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:46.920
That is the only difference between the two of you.

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:50.230
You're the one who said you were the same, Raiko.

00:21:50.230 --> 00:21:54.400
You'll have to continue hunting existences that were just like you.

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:56.560
I wanted to confirm your resolve.

00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:03.610
This woman worries for you in her own way, as to why...

00:22:03.610 --> 00:22:05.510
You talk too much.

00:22:07.080 --> 00:22:09.410
What is it, Kintoki?

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:12.220
What?

00:22:12.220 --> 00:22:15.120
No, no. It's nothing.

00:22:15.120 --> 00:22:16.780
What is it?!

00:22:30.900 --> 00:22:37.880
<i>Illusions of darkness</i> <i>reflect where there is light</i>

00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:44.820
<i>The way of the current world is so fleeting</i>

00:22:44.820 --> 00:22:51.990
<i>The fluttering butterfly that</i> <i>is drowning within your dreams</i>

00:22:51.990 --> 00:22:58.930
<i>Will only disappear if you</i> <i>reach out gently to touch it</i>

00:22:58.930 --> 00:23:02.500
<i>The dancing of the glowing flames (sweetly)</i>

00:23:02.500 --> 00:23:05.970
<i>The flower-like music (far away)</i>

00:23:05.970 --> 00:23:09.110
<i>The elegance of the moon</i>

00:23:09.110 --> 00:23:11.740
<i>Warmth that does not return (gently)</i>

00:23:11.740 --> 00:23:16.410
<i>Hold me (look for the light of twilight)</i>

00:23:16.410 --> 00:23:23.420
<i>Dance up high, passing</i> <i>everything down the family crest</i>

00:23:23.420 --> 00:23:29.860
<i>The heart you want to protect</i> <i>even to the end of all memory</i>

00:23:29.860 --> 00:23:37.130
<i>Dance and bloom proudly,</i> <i>these lights that call each other</i>

00:23:37.130 --> 00:23:40.440
<i>Will overlap and shine again</i>

00:23:40.440 --> 00:23:48.140
<i>These crimson flowers</i> <i>of oath that drift to and fro</i>

00:23:50.780 --> 00:24:00.790
"Next Episode: CURSE"

00:23:51.570 --> 00:23:53.730
Creatures that gather toward the light.

00:23:53.730 --> 00:23:56.440
Humans and insects are the same.

00:23:56.440 --> 00:24:00.270
Is what they both desire the same?
